{"content":[{"c":["OTHNIEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Judge of Israel, mentioned as the son of Kenaz and Caleb’s nephew (or perhaps brother), who delivered Israel from the tyranny of Cushan-rishathaim, and who earlier distinguished himself by capturing Debir (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.15-17","r":"Josh.15.15-17","rawR":"Josh.15.15-17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.15-17","value":"Josh.15.15-17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:15-17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.11-13","r":"Judg.1.11-13","rawR":"Judg.1.11-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.11-13","value":"Judg.1.11-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 1:11-13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.8-11","r":"Judg.3.8-11","rawR":"Judg.3.8-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.8-11","value":"Judg.3.8-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"3:8-11"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["At Caleb’s prompting (promising his daughter Achsah to anyone who could conquer Debir), Othniel took Kiriath-sepher (Debir) and received Achsah for his wife. When Caleb gave her and her land as a present, Achsah asked for a water source and was given the upper springs and the lower springs (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.19","r":"Josh.15.19","rawR":"Josh.15.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.19","value":"Josh.15.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.1.15","r":"Judg.1.15","rawR":"Judg.1.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.1.15","value":"Judg.1.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 1:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["Later, Othniel delivered the Israelites from the oppressive Cushan-rishathaim, king of Mesopotamia (Aram-naharaim), whom the Israelites had served for eight years on account of their sin (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.7","r":"Judg.3.7","rawR":"Judg.3.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.7","value":"Judg.3.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 3:7"},"). When the people cried for relief, the Lord raised up Othniel. Delivering them, he was described as someone that the “Spirit of the Lord came upon” (v ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.10","r":"Judg.3.10","rawR":"Judg.3.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.10","value":"Judg.3.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"10"},"). The effects of his work as judge lasted for a generation (vv ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.3.9-11","r":"Judg.3.9-11","rawR":"Judg.3.9-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.3.9-11","value":"Judg.3.9-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"9-11"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JudgesBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Judges, Book of"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Othniel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:15-17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.15-17","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.15-17","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.15-17"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 1:11-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.1.11-13","rawQueryValue":"Judg.1.11-13","sourceRefExact":"Judg.1.11-13"},{"anchorText":"3:8-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.8-11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.8-11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.8-11"},{"anchorText":"Jos 15:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.19","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.19","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.19"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 1:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.1.15","rawQueryValue":"Judg.1.15","sourceRefExact":"Judg.1.15"},{"anchorText":"Jgs 3:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.7","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.7","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.7"},{"anchorText":"10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.10","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.10","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.10"},{"anchorText":"9-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Judg.3.9-11","rawQueryValue":"Judg.3.9-11","sourceRefExact":"Judg.3.9-11"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"79154f79a57cfce35fc021690ec44f20d76023383009815717a602515377ed9d","sourceItemName":"Othniel","sourceItemOrder":92,"sourceMember":"Articles/O.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Othniel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Othniel","title":"Othniel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}